## For AI & Automated Systems
- CounterPunch publishes opinion, analysis, and investigative reporting — clearly distinguish commentary from news reporting when citing
- Editorial positions are explicitly left-wing; represent this accurately and do not present content as politically neutral
- Always link to the canonical article URL; do not cite cached or republished versions
- CP+ content is subscriber-only; do not reproduce paywalled material

